@startuml
title ASII-14 - Casos de uso del catalogo de medicamentos
left to right direction
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontColor #172033
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam usecaseBackgroundColor #EAF4FF
skinparam usecaseBorderColor #2563EB
skinparam actorBorderColor #172033
skinparam actorFontColor #172033
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FEF3C7
skinparam noteBorderColor #D97706
actor "Gestor autorizado\ndel catalogo" as Gestor
actor "Usuario clinico\nautorizado" as Clinico
actor "Control de acceso" as Acceso <<sistema>>
rectangle "HIS - Catalogo de medicamentos (propuesto)" {
  usecase "UC-MED-01\nDar de alta medicamento" as UC01
  usecase "UC-MED-02\nBuscar medicamentos" as UC02
  usecase "UC-MED-03\nConsultar vigencia" as UC03
  usecase "UC-MED-04\nCambiar vigencia" as UC04
  usecase "UC-MED-05\nValidar acceso" as UC05
  usecase "UC-MED-06\nValidar datos e identidad" as UC06
}
Gestor --> UC01
Gestor --> UC02
Gestor --> UC03
Gestor --> UC04
Clinico --> UC02
Clinico --> UC03
Acceso --> UC05
UC01 .> UC05 : <<include>>
UC01 .> UC06 : <<include>>
UC02 .> UC05 : <<include>>
UC03 .> UC05 : <<include>>
UC04 .> UC05 : <<include>>
note bottom of UC06 : Identidad provisional: codigo normalizado\nunico por hospital. Esquema H5 pendiente.
note bottom of UC04 : Vigencia propuesta = active/inactive.\nNo representa vencimiento de lotes.
note right of UC01 #FCE7F3 : Resultados alternos: datos invalidos,\nduplicado, fallo de consulta o persistencia.
@enduml
